    "ct_materials_main": {
      "type": "ct-materials",
      "blocks": {
        "material_1": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Non-stick",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-nonstick-real.webp",
            "badge": "Coated",
            "title": "Standard non-stick pan",
            "text": "<p>A synthetic coating does all the non-stick work. Overheating and metal utensils wear it down, and once it's scratched it keeps breaking down over time.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Coating",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "High heat or scratches",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "High",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Synthetic coating",
            "point_2": "Sensitive to high heat",
            "point_3": "Replaced every few years"
          }
        },
        "material_2": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Stainless steel",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-stainless-real.webp",
            "badge": "Sticky",
            "title": "Stainless steel pan",
            "text": "<p>Tough and coating-free, but food grips the surface unless you master heat and oil. Long simmers of acidic sauces can also react with the metal.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Metal traces",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Acidic, long cooks",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Food sticks easily",
            "point_2": "Takes practice",
            "point_3": "Reacts with acidic food"
          }
        },
        "material_3": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Cast iron",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-castiron-real.jpg",
            "badge": "High upkeep",
            "title": "Cast iron pan",
            "text": "<p>Great for searing, but heavy and dependent on seasoning. Skip a step and it rusts or reacts with acidic dishes.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Iron & rust",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Worn seasoning",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Heavy to handle",
            "point_2": "Needs regular seasoning",
            "point_3": "Rusts if left wet"
          }
        },
        "material_4": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Ceramic",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-ceramic-real.jpg",
            "badge": "Short-lived",
            "title": "Ceramic-coated pan",
            "text": "<p>A thin ceramic-style layer sits on an aluminium base. It feels slick at first, then gradually loses its release with heat and wear.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Coating chips",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "After months of use",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "Medium",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Non-stick fades quickly",
            "point_2": "Coating can chip",
            "point_3": "Short lifespan"
          }
        },
        "material_5": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "Hybrid",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okx-pan-hybrid-real.jpg",
            "badge": "Still coated",
            "title": "Hybrid pan",
            "text": "<p>A steel pattern laid over a non-stick coating. It looks like bare metal, but you're still cooking on a coating that wears like any other.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Coating",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "As it wears",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "High",
            "positive": false,
            "point_1": "Still relies on a coating",
            "point_2": "Coating wears off",
            "point_3": "Premium price"
          }
        },
        "material_6": {
          "type": "material",
          "settings": {
            "name": "CookingTitan",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/okura-hand-hammered-titanium-pan-01-hero_b39de0b9-8d90-4371-8208-13d68b6c9638.webp",
            "badge": "Coating-free",
            "title": "CookingTitan titanium pan",
            "text": "<p>A hand-hammered titanium cooking surface with no coating at all. Nothing to peel, chip or wear away, whatever the heat or the utensil.</p>",
            "stat_1_label": "Releases",
            "stat_1_value": "Nothing",
            "stat_2_label": "When",
            "stat_2_value": "Any heat",
            "stat_3_label": "Risk",
            "stat_3_value": "None",
            "positive": true,
            "point_1": "Titanium cooking surface",
            "point_2": "No coating to wear off",
            "point_3": "Metal-utensil friendly"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "material_1",
